of this study is to assess safety, tolerability, and pharmacokinetics of a medicine for Ebola
fever emergency prevention based on monoclonal recombinant antibodies ...
Eligibility: sex All; age 18 Years to 45 Years; healthy volunteers Accepts Healthy Volunteers
