Trial: NCT04299971
Title: Efficiency of Methotrexate and Tofacitinib in Mild and Moderate Patients
Conditions: Takayasu Arteritis; Methotrexate; Inhibition; Treatment
Interventions: Methotrexate Tablets; Tofacitinib tablet
Phase: Phase 4
